      "쉘 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (분리형) | [회사명] 베어링": "Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable) | [Company Name] Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</p> <h2>쉘 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (분리형)</h2> <p>니들 롤러가 케이지에 의해 안내되고 연마 가공된 외륜과 일체화된 형식으로, 비열처리 축에 내륜(Inner Ring)을 함께 사용할 수 있습니다.</p> <p>NK/NA49/NA69 계열(내륜 포함)과 RNA 계열(내륜 없음)로 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</p> <h2>Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Separable)</h2> <p>A type in which needle rollers are guided by a cage and integrated with a ground outer ring, allowing an inner ring to be used together with a non-hardened shaft.</p> <p>Supplied in the NK/NA49/NA69 series (with inner ring) and the RNA series (without inner ring).</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or a dimension.</p>",
      "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/shell_needle_separate.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>": "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Standard drawing from our SWS catalog</p> <img src=\"img/shell_needle_separate.png\" alt=\"Cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore) · D (outer diameter) · tolerance (d/D) · B (width)</p>",
